<title>USA: Harnischfeger extends Giddings tender offer.</title>
<headline>Harnischfeger extends Giddings tender offer.</headline>
<dateline>MILWAUKEE 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Harnischfeger Industries Inc said Monday that through May 30 it had received about 3,429,664 shares of Giddings &amp; Lewis Inc in response to its $19 per share tender offer for all shares, and it has extended the bid through June 6.</p>
<p>The tender offer and withdrawal rights were previously scheduled to expire at midnight on May 30.</p>
<p>Giddings has rejected Harnischfeger's bid as inadequate.</p>
<p>Harnischfeger makes equipment for underground mining, surface mining, pulp and papermaking, and materials handling.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
